# AES constant-time S-box: Boyar-Peralta's Boolean circuit, as used by
# BearSSL br_aes_ct_bitslice_Sbox. Each u32 is a plane of independent bytes;
# this module uses sixteen lanes for a block and four for a key word.
# Source: https://www.bearssl.org/gitweb/?p=BearSSL;a=blob;f=src/symcipher/aes_ct.c
# 
